* Load sidechain-only MSLD patch definitions (derived from the validated
* full-residue aa_l/aa_v/aa_w/aa_m/aa_f patches -- see build_sidechain_patches.py)
* Each adds ONLY the mutant sidechain (suffixed by its one-letter code) onto
* the existing, shared backbone. No backbone duplication, no CATS needed.
*
bomlev -1

stream "prep/patches/sc2l.rtf"
stream "prep/patches/sc2v.rtf"
stream "prep/patches/sc2w.rtf"
stream "prep/patches/sc2m.rtf"
stream "prep/patches/sc2f.rtf"

bomlev 0

return
